        <p>AND OTHER NOTED MAKERS.</p>
        <p>AND COUNTRY CHAT Subject : STRAIGHTFORWAbDNESS. HONESTY, LESS HUMBUG, AND FAIR DEALING. Mr. GERSHON is amused at the advertising war now rag- ing, and each"one seems to adopt the same ratans ky copying his advertisement. Mr. GERSHON implores all intending purchasers to beware of base imitations, who, jealous of his vast triumphs, puff their secondary goods, but which are in reality Much . inferior. Mr. GERSHON takes his stand upon the rock of "Honesty and Justice," which are the guiding principles of riktaishosa, and from which 'precepts time nor tide will cauit him recede.</p>
        <p>TOWN TALK</p>
        <p>TERMS OF BUSINESS : GOODS PACKED AND DELIVERED FREE. RAILWAY FARE PAID TO COUNTRY CUSTOMERS. GOODS STORED FREE TILL REQUITED. " REMEMBER." Any lot advertised may be had on the deferred payment system at a charge of 5 per cent. Goods exchanged if not :satisfactory. Mr. Gershon will pnrchase or take in exc:.ange a single article or complete houses of furniture. COMPARE PRICES. LATE THE PROPERTY OF A BANDMASTER. Complete house of furniture, consisting of the whole furniture f,r three rooms, sitting room, bedroom, full size bedstead, mattress, bf d, bolster, pillows, sheets, blankets, bolster case, pillow slips, and kitchen complete, all like new ; price 14 guineas, or 5 per cent extra on the deferred payment system. I C.ll and inspect them. No harm done if you don't buy.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL ARCA.DB, 44, Oldham-EU eet, Manchester. Cs ext to the Adelphi Bank). 1 ATE the PROPERTY of a SCHOOLMASTER. 1/ A Charming House of Furniture. really like new. It consists of dining mom suite in leather, extending dining table, carpet, rug, fender, fin. brasses, lace curtains, window pole complete, magnificent bedroom suite (not painted, solid wood), enclosed dressing-table, large bevelled glass attached; enclosed washstand, marble slab, tile back. and bevelled shav- ing mirror, they form to complete chest of drawers; full-size handsome black and brass bedstead, wire spring mattress, bed, holster, pillows, sheets, b ankets, pillow slips, bolster cases, toilet set, carpet, complete furniture for kitchen, floor- cloth for same, ditta for lobby and stairs. Call f.nd inspect the lot. Get a complete list, and you will say they are a marvel of cheapness for 24 guineas, or 5 per cent extra on the deterred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON, UNIVERSAL FURNISHING- ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Manehoster, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A POSTMASTER. Another complete home. we!) worthy ihe attention of those about furniithing. all made by a noted maker; dining- room ,drawin g-rcxorn ,three bedrooms complete and kitchen.any amount of sundries, all guaranteed. condition is spotless, call and see them, packed, warranted, and delivered for £3B, or 5 per cent. extra if on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, , Oldham-street. Manchester, next t.o the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A DOCTOR AT HIGHER BROUG HTO N. This lot was let on hire by a house who charged £175 for them ; the lot wants seeing to effect a speedy sale; magnifi- cent dining-room in solid walnut (the sideboard is well worth £25). the drawing-room in inlaid rosewood, the bedrooms are in satin walnut wood and American walnut. grand bedsteads, oil painting, kitchen furniture, dinner set, and sundries; space prevents anything like a eomp!ete list, call to see them. Don't forget they were sent (att on hire for £175 ; my price, £5B, or 5 per cent. extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
