        <p>ATE THE PROPEEIY OF AN ACCOUNT- Li ANT. Several BOOKCASES. In various sizes and wends. Very nice Mahoga.nv B ,olccase. 41t. wide, top part enclosed wit's- seass foldiag doors, moveable shelves, lower portion enclosed with cupboards and drawers; price. only £.4 18s. Another slt. wile ; annther 61t. wide, and a Grano Carved Oak Book- case; cost £BO. for 27 guineas.</p>
        <p>ON VIRW AT GERSHON'S UVIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE. 44. OLDHAM-STREET, MANCHESTER.</p>
