      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-03-14_WidnesExaminer_art0015" n="art0015">
        <p>MADE-UP DISHES</p>
        <p>hich are a most important the week's menu of household, are made piquant and tasty the addition of</p>
        <p>BOVRIL,</p>
        <p>'hich is the guaranteed product of</p>
        <p>RIME ox BEEF .nd which imparts the all flavour of Fresh Meat to even the most tasteles dish.</p>
