        <p>CAPITOLA THE MADCAP. ' BY MR&amp; E. D. E. N. SOUTIIWORTH.</p>
        <p>CHAPTER XXVM.</p>
        <p>A PANIC IN THE OUTLAW'S BEN. "Imagination frames events unknow,n In wild fantastic shapes of hideous ruin, And what it fears creates I" —HANNAH MORIL</p>
