        <p>lANCASHIRE ASYLUMS BOARD.—WANTED a CLBRIC of the Works to SUPBRINTRNT the MAKING OF THE BRICKS for the New Asylum at Winwick, near Warrington, and alsothe erection of the. bridges in connection with the Railway Siding and the laying down of the Railway Siding Salary, £3 per week. Applications to b 3 made in candidates own hand-writing, stating age and qualiqcation, and accompanied by copies of not more than three recent testimonials, to be forwarded to the undersigned, under cover, endorsed "Clerk of the Works, Winwick," not later than Saturday. 21st March next. Personal canvassing will be deemed to be a disqualification. FRED. C. BULTON, Clerk to the Lancashire Asylums Board. County Offices, Preston. 25th February. 1E96.</p>
